        {
          "id": "wwm-9",
          "type": "text",
          "data": {
            "html": "<p>Hard municipal water leaves calcium soap curds on raw Cheviot wool, dulling the dye uptake. Drawing soft water straight from the burn behind our 1892 carding shed leaves one percent natural lanolin in the yarn for weather resistance.</p>",
